          "short": "$12$ square units.",
          "worked": "The base is $4$ units and the perpendicular height is $3$ units.\n$$\\begin{align*} A &= bh \\\\ A &= 4\\times3 \\\\ A &= 12\\text{ square units}. \\end{align*}$$",
